        expires: '2026-11-09T00:00:00.000Z'
  SNYK-JS-UNDICI-21185768:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          Same root cause and dependency path as SNYK-JS-UNDICI-19635210 —
          npm's bundled node-gyp/undici@6.28.0, build-time only, no fix
          currently available upstream without patching npm's tree.
        expires: '2026-11-09T00:00:00.000Z'
  SNYK-JS-PICOMATCH-21248802:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          picomatch@4.0.4 resolved via npm's own bundled tooling
          (npm@11.19.1 > node-gyp@12.4.0 > tinyglobby@0.2.17 > picomatch),
          surfaced only in the "lib" project (/usr/local/lib/node_modules);
          app scan clean. Build/CLI tooling only, never exercised by the
          running application. No upgrade or patch available. Recheck when
          a fix is published and npm bundles it.
        expires: '2026-11-09T00:00:00.000Z'
  SNYK-JS-BRACEEXPANSION-20244948:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          brace-expansion@5.0.9 resolved transitively via npm's bundled
          minimatch (npm@11.19.1 > minimatch@10.2.5 > brace-expansion@5.0.9).
          Build/CLI tooling only — not present in the application runtime
          path (app scan clean). Fixed in 5.0.11, but the version bundled
          by npm isn't independently controllable without patching npm's
          tree. Recheck when npm bumps its bundled brace-expansion again.
        expires: '2026-11-09T00:00:00.000Z'
  SNYK-JS-BRACEEXPANSION-20244952:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          Same root cause and dependency path as
          SNYK-JS-BRACEEXPANSION-20244948 — build/CLI tooling only, no
          direct upgrade available while bundled by npm (fixed in 5.0.10).
        expires: '2026-11-09T00:00:00.000Z'
  SNYK-JS-POSTCSSSELECTORPARSER-20510276:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          postcss-selector-parser@7.1.4 resolved transitively via npm's own
          dependency-resolution tooling (npm@11.19.1 > @npmcli/arborist@9.9.1
          > @npmcli/query@5.0.0 > postcss-selector-parser@7.1.4). Build/CLI
          tooling only, surfaced by the container scan against the "lib"
          project (/usr/local/lib/node_modules, npm's own global install) —
          not the application's own dependency tree (app scan clean). Fixed
          in postcss-selector-parser@7.1.6, but the version bundled by npm
          isn't independently controllable without patching npm itself.
          Recheck when npm bumps its bundled dependency.
        expires: '2026-11-09T00:00:00.000Z'
  SNYK-JS-HTTPCACHESEMANTICS-19964064:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          http-cache-semantics@4.2.0 resolved as npm's own internal HTTP
          client dependency (npm@11.19.1 > make-fetch-happen@15.0.6 >
          http-cache-semantics@4.2.0), used only by npm itself during
          package install/registry requests — surfaced solely in the "lib"
          project scan (/usr/local/lib/node_modules, npm's own global
          install), not the application's own dependency tree (app scan
          clean, 306 dependencies tested). Build/CLI tooling only, not
          independently controllable without patching npm's tree. Recheck
          when npm bumps its bundled make-fetch-happen.
        expires: '2026-11-09T00:00:00.000Z'
  SNYK-JS-HTTPCACHESEMANTICS-19964068:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          Same root cause as SNYK-JS-HTTPCACHESEMANTICS-19964064 — npm's
          own bundled make-fetch-happen, build/CLI tooling only, never
          exercised by this application's own code.
        expires: '2026-11-09T00:00:00.000Z'
  SNYK-DEBIAN13-ZLIB-19520500:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          zlib1g, introduced by the base image node:24.22.1-trixie-slim via
          dpkg/apt — a base-OS package, not an application dependency. No
          fix published for Debian 13 (trixie) yet; base-image upgrade
          recommendations (e.g. alpine) are a separate, bigger migration and
          not being done as a point fix. Accepted pending upstream Debian
          patch or a deliberate base-image migration. Recheck on base-image
          bump. (Confirmed still present after the 24.18.1 -> 24.22.1
          bump — sqlite3/perl-base/pcre2/gzip were all resolved by that
          same bump, but zlib/attr/acl have no Debian fix published at
          all yet, so a tag swap alone can't reach them.)
        expires: '2026-11-09T00:00:00.000Z'
  SNYK-DEBIAN13-ATTR-17678182:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          libattr1, introduced by the base image
          node:24.22.1-trixie-slim via coreutils/adduser — a base-OS
          package, not an application dependency. No fix published for
          Debian 13 (trixie); base-image upgrade recommendations do not
          resolve it. Accepted pending upstream Debian patch or a base-image
          migration. Recheck on base-image bump.
        expires: '2026-11-09T00:00:00.000Z'
  SNYK-DEBIAN13-ACL-17677866:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          libacl1, introduced by the base image
          node:24.22.1-trixie-slim via coreutils/sed/adduser/dpkg — a
          base-OS package, not an application dependency. No fix published
          for Debian 13 (trixie); base-image upgrade recommendations do not
          resolve it. Accepted pending upstream Debian patch or a base-image
          migration. Recheck on base-image bump.
        expires: '2026-11-09T00:00:00.000Z'
